AGENTMESH AGENT
===============
Autonomous AI agent powered by Google Gemini.
Discovers APIs from the AgentMesh catalog and pays for them autonomously via x402.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SETUP
    1. Install dependencies
            cd agent
            npm install

    2. Configure environment
            cp .env.example .env
            # Fill in:
            #   GEMINI_API_KEY      — from https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
            #   AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY   — wallet private key with MockUSDC balance
            #   FACILITATOR_ADDRESS — X402Facilitator contract address

    3. Make sure the backend is running
            cd apps/backend && pnpm dev

    4. Run the agent
            node index.mjs
            # or with a custom task:
            node index.mjs "What is the BTC/ETH ratio and is gas cheap right now?"
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HOW IT WORKS
    1. Agent fetches the catalog from GET /api/v1/catalog
    2. Catalog is converted to Gemini function/tool definitions
    3. Agent sends the task + tools to Gemini
    4. Gemini decides which APIs to call (no hardcoding)
    5. Agent executes each call with x402 payment (signs autonomously)
    6. Results are sent back to Gemini
    7. Gemini synthesizes a final analysis
    8. Zero human interaction throughout
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
REQUIREMENTS
    - Node.js 18+
    - AgentMesh backend running (pnpm dev in apps/backend)
    - Agent wallet with MockUSDC balance
    - Agent wallet has approved X402Facilitator (one-time setup)
    - Gemini API key
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EXAMPLE TASKS
    node index.mjs "Analyze the crypto market and give me a trading recommendation"
    node index.mjs "What is the current gas price and is it a good time to transact?"
    node index.mjs "Compare BTC and ETH performance and calculate their ratio"
    node index.mjs "Give me a full market overview of all available crypto prices"
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
